human_review_comments.body:
@WittierDinosaur ,  well, I forgot, that there was a purpose to keep `include_position` separate: all the The YAML fixtures expect now 2-element tuples (no position info) when `include_meta=True`. 

So if we want to use ONLY the `include_meta`, then ALL the YAML fixtures should be updated which are using 'include_meta' to have them position info. If I'm not mistaken all such YAML files are related to the jinja templater (around a dozen or so).

Is that what you want, or should we still keep the `include_position` in order to avoid changing the fixtures?

