This comment is slightly misleading. It states that the functions are "copied verbatim" from `DataConnectPathSegment.kt`, but some functions, like `appendPathStringTo`, have different implementations (e.g., quoting field names) to preserve the behavior from the old `ProtoValuePath.kt` that tests rely on.

To avoid confusion, I suggest updating the comment to clarify that these are test-specific utilities adapted for `DataConnectPathSegment`.

```suggestion
// NOTE: Many of the functions below provide test utilities for working with `DataConnectPath`.
// They are similar to the internal helpers in
// `src/main/kotlin/com/google/firebase/dataconnect/DataConnectPathSegment.kt`, but some have
// been adapted for testing purposes (e.g., `toPathString` quotes fields).
```

