I tested and contrary to the documentation  DROP COLUMN col1, col2 is valid and executed  by the server and works as expected.  I did discover there was an outer Delimited section that was not needed and was allowing invalid and mixed alter table statements like:
ALTER TABLE dbo.SomeTable ADD COLUMN SomeCol int, DROP COLUMN SomeOtherColumn;  
Which is against the documentation and SQL considers invalid as well.

